<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E33 Linguistic Object"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E33 Linguistic Object is used to identify paratextual passages (epitextual or peritextual) in which the author or editor of the volume declares the use of a literary constraint. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P129_is_about, crm:P3_has_note, crm:P67_refers_to and prov:wasAttributedTo."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E33 Linguistic Object è utilizzata per identificare passaggi paratestuali (epitestuali o peritestuali) nei quali l'autore o il curatore del volume dichiara l'utilizzo di una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P129_is_about, crm:P3_has_note, crm:P67_refers_to e prov:wasAttributedTo."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E33 Oggetto Linguistico"@it .
